<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Sheikh Sanan (Huseyn Javid)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">early 20th century</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the story retold in a play</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Sari Gelin (Kardeş Türküler)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1997</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recorded as &quot;Sari Gyalin (Dağlı Gelin)&quot;</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Sari Gelin (film, Yaver Rzayev)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1999</span><span class="sg-chain-h">adapted as a film</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Endless Vision (Djivan Gasparyan and Hossein Alizadeh)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2006</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recorded on an album</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Sari Gelin (Sami Yusuf, The Centre)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2014</span><span class="sg-chain-h">a version in English and Azerbaijani</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Sari Aghjik (Armenia TV series)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2020</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, used as the soundtrack</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Ap ton Erota ston Akheronta (Christos C. Papadopoulos)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new Greek words to the same melody</span></li></ul></section>
